WEBVTT

13:01.891 --> 13:04.060
This is no toy.

13:06.103 --> 13:08.898
- Little ladies shouldn't play with swords.
- I wasn't playing.

13:09.023 --> 13:10.941
And I don't want to be a lady.

13:11.859 --> 13:13.235
Come here.

13:18.908 --> 13:20.826
Now what do you want with this?

13:20.951 --> 13:23.245
It's called Needle.

13:23.371 --> 13:25.414
Oh, a blade with a name.

13:26.749 --> 13:29.126
And who were you hoping
to skewer with Needle?

13:29.251 --> 13:31.170
Your sister?
